Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:59:37 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(embed): start an embedded run on a requested
 terminal

A program that embeds the client (cli::run_embedded) can name the terminal to focus once the inventory first lists it: the same path as a pane-row click, taken once. A plain run is unchanged.
